<title>JAPAN: Japan Sept rapeseed imports jump 31.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Sept rapeseed imports jump 31.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's rapeseed imports in September totalled 164,776 tonnes, 31.4 percent higher than the 125,434 tonnes imported a year earlier, according to Finance Ministry statistics released on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The breakdown was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>			Sept 96	 Aug 96	 Sept 95</p>
<p> Total rapeseed   164,776	 109,649	125,434</p>
<p> Major suppliers of rapeseed (in tonnes):</p>
<p> Canada	     157,379	  89,708	125,407</p>
<p> France		 6,541	     nil	    nil</p>
<p>Imports in the first nine months of 1996 were 1,417,257 tonnes, versus 1,311,015 tonnes in the same period of 1995. -- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7431</p>
</text>
